[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0574","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0574.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54560","title":"Cloudreve Cloudreve OAuth 权限绕过漏洞","description":"Cloudreve 自托管文件管理系统存在 OAuth 访问令牌绕过范围强制执行漏洞。漏洞原理是 OAuth 访问令牌在签发时缺失 `client_id` 声明，导致 JWT 验证器未将令牌作用域加载至请求上下文，使得 `RequiredScopes(...)` 中间件误判为无作用域的第一方会话认证而跳过作用域检查。影响范围为 Cloudreve 4.12.0 至 4.16.1 版本，已在 4.16.1 修复。攻击条件为攻击者需持有合法用户的低权限 OAuth 访问令牌（如仅授权 `openid` 作用域），利用方式为攻击者使用该令牌作为 Bearer Token 调用需高权限作用域的 API（如文件读写、分享管理、工作流、用户设置、WebDAV 账户、管理员接口），因作用域检查被绕过而成功访问或篡改敏感资源，管理员账号甚至可触及管理员级 API。CVSS 评分 7.6（HIGH），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，需低权限和用户交互，机密性与完整性影响高，可用性影响低。CVE-2026-54560 对应 CWE-863（错误的授权）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54560","GHSA-vgj4-345g-jcf8"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15T15:16:44Z","updated":"2026-07-15T18:15:13Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Cloudreve 到 4.16.1 或更高版本（下载地址：https://github.com/cloudreve/cloudreve/releases/tag/4.16.1）。升级前请备份数据库和配置文件，按官方文档执行升级步骤。若暂时无法升级，可在管理后台禁用 OAuth 功能或删除所有 OAuth 客户端配置作为临时缓解措施，并限制管理员账号进行 OAuth 授权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/cloudreve/cloudreve/commit/ed20843dc3df20a25fcaf6b538647e11c4d68d87","https://github.com/cloudreve/cloudreve/releases/tag/4.16.1","https://github.com/cloudreve/cloudreve/security/advisories/GHSA-vgj4-345g-jcf8","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54560.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-15/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54560.md","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/869f3abc79bfeaf3a31640839c1759509ebcc74c/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-54560/README.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v4/CVE-2026-54560.yml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54560.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/reports/GO-2026-6022.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-vgj4-345g-jcf8/GHSA-vgj4-345g-jcf8.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/347fea450bbb600a02904f9eaa5ce5c35747c461/data/2026/CVE-2026-54560.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2026-07-16_zh.md","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0574.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0236","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0236.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"adawolfa isdoc 未受控资源消耗漏洞（解压炸弹）","description":"adawolfa/isdoc 在读取 ISDOCX（ZIP）档案和嵌有 ISDOC 文档的 PDF 文件时，未对解压后数据大小进行校验，存在解压炸弹漏洞（CWE-400/CWE-409）。攻击者可构造特制的恶意文件，通过 getFromName() 解压 ISDOC 文档或 saveTo() 复制附件时，将极小文件膨胀至数 GB，导致内存或磁盘耗尽造成拒绝服务。该漏洞不影响机密性和完整性，仅影响可用性，需要用户打开恶意文件才能触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["GHSA-xg43-5579-qw6v"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 1.4.3、1.5.1、1.6.1 或 2.0.0 及以上版本。修复版本在解压前通过 statName() 读取 ZIP 中央目录中未压缩大小，对 ISDOC 文档限制 256KB、附件限制 32MB、PDF 内嵌文件限制 256MB，超出即抛出 ReaderException::zipEntryTooLarge() 等异常并中止。1.0–1.3 系列因生命周期终止不受支持，须升级到维护版本。临时措施：限制仅解析受信任来源的文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/adawolfa/isdoc/security/advisories/GHSA-xg43-5579-qw6v","https://github.com/adawolfa/isdoc/commit/935fb2aa41ceddfcf43174a61a36ec620611a105","https://github.com/adawolfa/isdoc/commit/02a10123a3d5fd92950b8e4952959317c0a18952","https://github.com/adawolfa/isdoc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0236.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0052","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0052.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"奇安信网神 SecGate 3600 防火墙 obj_app_upfile 接口任意文件上传漏洞","description":"奇安信网神 SecGate 3600 防火墙的 obj_app_upfile 接口存在任意文件上传漏洞（CWE-434）。攻击者可通过构造特制的 multipart 请求包，向服务器上传包含恶意代码的 PHP 文件，从而获取服务器完全控制权限。该漏洞影响 SecGate 3600 系列防火墙设备，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["NUCLEI-HTTP-VULNERABILITIES-SECWORLD-SECGATE-3600-FILE-UPLOAD-YAML"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 SecGate 3600 防火墙固件至最新安全版本，限制 obj_app_upfile 接口的访问来源 IP，并在 Web 应用防火墙上添加文件上传检测规则以拦截恶意文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T01:53:16Z","references":["https://peiqi.wgpsec.org/wiki/iot/%E5%A5%87%E5%AE%89%E4%BF%A1/%E7%BD%91%E7%A5%9E%20SecGate%203600%20%E9%98%B2%E7%81%AB%E5%A2%99%20obj_app_upfile%20%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.html","https://github.com/PeiQi0/PeiQi-WIKI-Book/blob/main/docs/wiki/iot/%E5%A5%87%E5%AE%89%E4%BF%A1/%E7%BD%91%E7%A5%9E%20SecGate%203600%20%E9%98%B2%E7%81%AB%E5%A2%99%20obj_app_upfile%20%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md"],"poc_urls":["https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/vulnerabilities/secworld/secgate-3600-file-upload.yaml"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0052.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0856","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0856.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59889","title":"FasterXML Jackson-databind @JsonView反序列化权限绕过漏洞","description":"Jackson Databind 在处理 @JsonUnwrapped 注解的容器属性时存在视图绕过漏洞。UnwrappedPropertyHandler.processUnwrapped() 方法在反序列化过程中未对 prop.visibleInView(ctxt.getActiveView()) 进行校验，导致同时标注了 @JsonView 和 @JsonUnwrapped 的属性在低权限视图下仍能被攻击者 JSON 数据写入。攻击者可通过向使用 Jackson 进行 JSON 反序列化的服务端发送特制 JSON 载荷，绕过 @JsonView 的写权限控制，实现权限提升或敏感字段赋值（如角色、审批状态、信用额度等）。该漏洞影响 jackson-databind 2.18.0 至 2.18.9、2.21.5、2.22.1、3.1.5、3.2.1 之前版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59889","GHSA-5gvw-p9qm-jgwh"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T21:17:06Z","updated":"2026-07-16T16:19:15Z","remediation":"升级 jackson-databind 至以下修复版本：2.x 系列升级到 2.18.9、2.21.5 或 2.22.1；3.x 系列升级到 3.1.5 或 3.2.1。如使用 Maven，在 pom.xml 中更新 `com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind` 版本号；如使用 Gradle，更新 `implementation 'com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind:2.22.1'`。无法立即升级时，避免在 `@JsonView` 保护的容器属性上同时使用 `@JsonUnwrapped` 注解，并设置 `MapperFeature.DEFAULT_VIEW_INCLUSION=false` 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/FasterXML/jackson-databind/commit/d627a8a86fcb062429282f79f3f256f181ed2c7b","https://github.com/FasterXML/jackson-databind/issues/6060","https://github.com/FasterXML/jackson-databind/pull/6056","https://github.com/FasterXML/jackson-databind/security/advisories/GHSA-5gvw-p9qm-jgwh","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2026/CVE-2026-59889.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59889.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0fed28f73afbb5eb38c05b167f63ae6a3a91eb60/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59889.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59889.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59889.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59889.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59889.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59889.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59889.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59889.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0856.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0095","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0095.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53486","title":"npm decompress 路径穿越漏洞","description":"npm decompress 包在解压归档文件时存在路径穿越漏洞（CWE-22）。该漏洞源于三个方面：硬链接和符号链接条目未检查目标指向，导致可读取任意文件暴露到输出目录或劫持写入操作到目录之外；路径包含性检查仅使用简单字符串前缀比对，未对`../`等跨目录条目进行转义；文件权限模式未移除 setuid/setgid/sticky 位。攻击者可通过构造恶意归档文件，实现向目标目录之外任意位置读写文件。该漏洞影响 10.2.1 和 11.1.3 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.1，危害等级严重，每周约 280 万次下载。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53486"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-14T21:17:05Z","updated":"2026-07-15T20:29:17Z","remediation":"将 `@xhmikosr/decompress` 升级至 10.2.1 或 11.1.3 及以上版本。升级后应对解压目录启用沙箱隔离机制，限制解压进程对输出目录外的文件系统访问权限。同时建议在解压前校验压缩包条目的路径合法性，拒绝包含绝对路径或上级目录引用的条目。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/XhmikosR/decompress/commit/281cefa00cd4275c10479bc5f1abba6b14dee8bd","https://github.com/XhmikosR/decompress/commit/60b5299402e72b0b53ca2e55222e9a1ccb44afae","https://github.com/XhmikosR/decompress/commit/9fcda4b0a66ca22dc8d337f9b0e7c30293c5fb89","https://github.com/XhmikosR/decompress/commit/aca5aac415dc04a6fae5200e51368cff436a09dd","https://github.com/XhmikosR/decompress/releases/tag/v10.2.1","https://github.com/XhmikosR/decompress/releases/tag/v11.1.3","https://github.com/XhmikosR/decompress/security/advisories/GHSA-mp2f-45pm-3cg9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ed3e8dec058a54f5d840cd78ee86185dee6350a7/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53486.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_2_CVE-2026-53486.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ccf2cc3d762789b06638ba5aa3e06982a53080c8/npm/decompress/CVE-2026-53486.yml","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2026/CVE-2026-53486/README.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c008a0d6321845785f09dbf3840663b1f3185336/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53486.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/23e59fd10f7619445bb3ab1ba838f2e531989c40/content/posts/cve-2026-53486.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/npm_decompress_%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E7%A9%BF%E8%B6%8A%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-53486.toml","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/d96cdcee4ef80f9187069a225f8b6e61537923c7/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-53486/README.md","https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/catalog/blob/f4dc551471d9e9ce3a9a5b95f1f4512ba83af5b2/image/hubble-ui/patch/remove-decompress.patch","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-mp2f-45pm-3cg9/GHSA-mp2f-45pm-3cg9.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-53486"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0095.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0314","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0314.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49477","title":"Soup Sieve CSS选择器解析器正则表达式拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Soup Sieve（Beautiful Soup 4 使用的 CSS 选择器引擎）在 css_parser.py 中处理属性选择器时，其正则表达式存在灾难性回溯漏洞。当解析未闭合引号的属性值时，VALUE 正则模式进入指数级回溯，仅需约 300 字节的恶意载荷即可导致 CPU 占用超过 3 秒。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向使用 soupsieve.compile() 或 Beautiful Soup 的 .select()/.select_one() 方法的 Python 应用提交特制的 CSS 选择器字符串，触发正则表达式拒绝服务（ReDoS），导致服务线程阻塞和 CPU 资源耗尽。该漏洞影响 soupsieve 2.8.4 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。由于 soupsieve 是 beautifulsoup4 的自动依赖项，广泛部署的 Python Web 应用均受影响。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49477","GHSA-836r-79rf-4m37"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T21:17:02Z","updated":"2026-07-21T16:17:13Z","remediation":"立即将 soupsieve 升级至 2.8.4 或更高版本（`pip install --upgrade soupsieve`）。如无法升级，避免将用户可控的 CSS 选择器字符串传入 `soupsieve.compile()` 或 Beautiful Soup 的 `.select()` / `.select_one()` 方法，并在应用层对输入长度和字符集做严格限制（如拒绝包含未闭合引号的输入）以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/eb4397618709186c109400448c6043b728217dc3","https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/releases/tag/2.8.4","https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/security/advisories/GHSA-836r-79rf-4m37","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49477.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-49477.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-49477.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/soupsieve/CVE-2026-49477.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-49477","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-49477.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49477.json","https://github.com/SolaceLabs/solace-agent-mesh/blob/f76d8972fecac522055e8195b704ec631c698c99/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/browser-use/workflow-use/blob/fa53b3d4e49356f81f3c70496d54a465da30e93d/workflows/pyproject.toml","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/82ea664714059279a483073ac2764b0de54527ea/posts/cve-2026-49477-pip-soupsieve.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0314.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0313","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0313.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49476","title":"Soup Sieve CSS选择器解析器资源耗尽漏洞","description":"Soup Sieve（Beautiful Soup 4 的 CSS 选择器引擎）在解析大型逗号分隔选择器列表时存在内存耗尽漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需向 soupsieve.compile() 或 Beautiful Soup 的 .select()/.select_one() 方法提交特制的 CSS 选择器字符串（如 500KB 输入可触发约 244MB 堆内存分配，放大比达 488 倍），即可导致目标应用内存耗尽，引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 soupsieve < 2.8.4 版本，所有依赖 beautifulsoup4 且接受用户 CSS 选择器输入的 Python Web 应用均受影响。已在 soupsieve 2.8.4 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49476","GHSA-2wc2-fm75-p42x"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T21:17:01Z","updated":"2026-07-15T20:22:12Z","remediation":"立即将 soupsieve 升级至 2.8.4 或更高版本：`pip install --upgrade soupsieve`。如无法立即升级，在调用 `soupsieve.compile()` 或 Beautiful Soup 的 `.select()`/`.select_one()` 前，对用户输入的 CSS 选择器字符串进行长度和逗号数量限制（如限制不超过 1024 字符且逗号分隔项不超过 100 个），或使用输入白名单过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/28108ab805818c832d9568142a99844fd95a0d39","https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/releases/tag/2.8.4","https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/security/advisories/GHSA-2wc2-fm75-p42x","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49476.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-49476.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-49476.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/soupsieve/CVE-2026-49476.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-49476.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-49476","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49476.json","https://github.com/SolaceLabs/solace-agent-mesh/blob/f76d8972fecac522055e8195b704ec631c698c99/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/robocorp/rpaframework/blob/2b3d3c4bd44d622efde7301c7bd5c3abfb612265/docs/source/releasenotes.rst","https://github.com/browser-use/workflow-use/blob/fa53b3d4e49356f81f3c70496d54a465da30e93d/workflows/pyproject.toml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0313.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1138","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1138.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-48344","title":"Adobe Creative Cloud Desktop 时间检查与时间使用竞态条件漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>Adobe Creative Cloud Desktop 存在时间检查与时间使用（TOCTOU）竞争条件漏洞（CWE-367）。该漏洞源于程序在检查文件状态与实际使用文件之间存在时间差，攻击者可利用此窗口期通过竞争条件实现任意代码执行，代码将以当前登录用户的权限运行。该漏洞影响本地安装的 Creative Cloud Desktop 应用程序，利用过程依赖攻击者无法完全控制的系统条件（如文件系统时序），但无需任何用户交互即可触发。由于漏洞导致权限范围改变（Scope Changed），成功利用可能使攻击者在当前用户上下文中获得完全控制权。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-48344"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-14T21:17:00Z","updated":"2026-07-17T03:23:06Z","remediation":"立即升级到Adobe Creative Cloud Desktop最新稳定版本（2026.8.120及以上），确保已安装所有7月补丁包。临时缓解措施：运行软件时使用有限用户权限，避免管理员账户；停用桌面所有自动重启功能，防止攻击者重新加载恶意DLL；可配置应用信任名单，仅允许签署的执行文件运行，阻止未经验证的未经检测进程。参考Adobe安全公告ADV26-01，建议在72小时内完成补丁安装。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/creative-cloud/apsb26-77.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48344.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48344.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-48344.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-48344.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2026-48344.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/8a9f1e134a847eb59530b63828f75867023ec363/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_2_CVE-2026-48344.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-483xx/CVE-2026-48344.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/95dfeac19c1312c71635dbff08ef6b821c8309c0/content/posts/cve-2026-48344.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2e01b8ab6dee830118caf8c9609e7908ef49eeb7/2026/CVE-2026-48344.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/514c5de1bed57e2dcb3d56992a549e0097d9794f/api/2026/CVE-2026-48344.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1138.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1130","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1130.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-48272","title":"Adobe Creative Cloud Desktop 搜索路径可控漏洞","description":"Adobe Creative Cloud Desktop 应用程序存在未受控搜索路径元素漏洞（CWE-427）。该漏洞源于程序加载动态链接库时搜索路径包含可被攻击者控制的目录，本地低权限攻击者可将恶意 DLL 放置于该目录下，诱使应用程序加载并执行恶意代码，从而在当前用户上下文中实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Creative Cloud Desktop 6.9.1.1 及更早版本，利用需要本地访问权限与较低权限，但攻击复杂度较高且依赖特定运行环境，成功利用后可完全控制用户系统并造成机密性、完整性和可用性的严重影响。Adobe 已在 6.10.0.252.3 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-48272"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-14T21:16:57Z","updated":"2026-07-17T03:24:18Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Adobe Creative Cloud Desktop 升级至 6.10.0.252.3 或更高版本。操作方式：打开 Creative Cloud 应用程序，依次点击「帮助」→「检查更新」，或前往 Adobe 官网下载最新版安装包覆盖安装。如企业环境中无法立即升级，可在部署前临时移除包含受影响组件的旧版安装，或通过组策略限制非管理员用户对 Creative Cloud 安装目录的写入权限，以缓解 DLL 劫持风险。请参见 Adobe 安全公告 APSB26-77（https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/creative-cloud/apsb26-77.html）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/creative-cloud/apsb26-77.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48272.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48272.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-48272.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-48272.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2026-48272.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/8a9f1e134a847eb59530b63828f75867023ec363/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_2_CVE-2026-48272.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-482xx/CVE-2026-48272.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/95dfeac19c1312c71635dbff08ef6b821c8309c0/content/posts/cve-2026-48272.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b4388551935a161c058c6e5c833599d33c7e097/2026/CVE-2026-48272.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/514c5de1bed57e2dcb3d56992a549e0097d9794f/api/2026/CVE-2026-48272.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1130.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0363","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0363.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50659","title":"Microsoft .NET SMTP 客户端消息欺骗漏洞","description":"Microsoft .NET 的 SMTP 客户端实现（System.Net.Mail）存在输出编码或转义不当漏洞（CWE-116），攻击者可在邮件消息路由过程中进行消息欺骗，使接收方看到伪造的发件人地址或内容。该漏洞影响 .NET 8.0（低于 8.0.29）、.NET 9.0（低于 9.0.18）及 .NET 10.0（低于 10.0.10）的所有平台与架构版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级为中危。攻击者需具备较低权限并在网络上具备授权访问能力，无需用户交互即可发起利用。Microsoft 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，建议升级至最新的 .NET 版本并重新编译部署自包含应用程序。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50659","GHSA-74jp-vm22-8q8x"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T20:17:38Z","updated":"2026-07-22T21:17:42Z","remediation":".NET 8.0 应用升级至 8.0.29，.NET 9.0 升级至 9.0.18，.NET 10.0 升级至 10.0.10；通过 NuGet 更新 Microsoft.NetCore.App.Runtime 相关程序包引用并重新编译，或使用 dotnet --info 确认当前版本后通过 Visual Studio 更新至最新 .NET SDK，自包含部署的应用须重新编译并重新部署，更新后重启应用使补丁生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-50659","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/8284a6b46d384416350a482bbbfb023f0fdf4177/release-notes/10.0/cve.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50659.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-50659","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/5e42b0394af9ea9a92d3a9525f7e445dad9e5f7c/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-50659.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/76fdd7fe4cd9d55f9aa8c105cb90aa42e34c98b9/content/posts/cve-2026-50659.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/nuget/Microsoft.NETCore.App.Runtime.win-x86/CVE-2026-50659.yml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2026-50659.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-50659.json","https://github.com/dotnet/docs/blob/b2bd326ace411a28756f9f2e93e21ff289840a56/docs/framework/release-notes/2026/07-14-july-cumulative-update.md","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/8dc9755558332e693602179ac57756a8496a6041/community/dotnet9-runtime/APKBUILD"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0363.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0362","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0362.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50651","title":"微软 .NET HTTP/2 拒绝服务漏洞","description":".NET HTTP客户端存在 HTTP/2 协议处理缺陷，攻击者可通过发送特制 HTTP/2 数据流触发无限制资源分配（CWE-770），导致进程内存耗尽引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 .NET 8.0（≤8.0.28）、.NET 9.0（≤9.0.17）、.NET 10.0（≤10.0.9）全平台全架构版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.5（HIGH，AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H）。攻击者无需身份认证、无需用户交互，仅需通过网络发送恶意 HTTP/2 请求即可远程触发内存耗尽，导致 .NET 应用崩溃拒绝服务。自包含部署应用需重新编译部署修复版本（.NET 8.0.29/9.0.18/10.0.10）方能修复。Microsoft 已于 2026 年 7 月发布安全公告并提供修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50651","GHSA-wp74-jgxh-gv4q"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T20:17:38Z","updated":"2026-07-22T21:17:42Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 .NET 运行时到修复版本：.NET 8.0 升级至 8.0.29，.NET 9.0 升级至 9.0.18，.NET 10.0 升级至 10.0.10。通过 `dotnet --info` 检查当前版本，使用 `dotnet workload update` 或下载安装程序更新 SDK/运行时，引用 NuGet 包的项目更新 Microsoft.NetCore.App.Runtime.* 包至对应修复版本并重新编译部署自包含应用。临时缓解可在 Kestrel/ASP.NET Core 中设置 `Limits.MaxConcurrentConnections` 限制并发连接数，或在反向代理层限制 HTTP/2 并发流数。更新后需重启所有 .NET 应用使补丁生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-50651","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/8284a6b46d384416350a482bbbfb023f0fdf4177/release-notes/10.0/cve.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50651.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-50651.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dde61f61b53e6605a407232356bfa1ca7643b1ec/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50651.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-50651","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/5e42b0394af9ea9a92d3a9525f7e445dad9e5f7c/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-50651.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/nuget/Microsoft.NETCore.App.Runtime.win-x64/CVE-2026-50651.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/76fdd7fe4cd9d55f9aa8c105cb90aa42e34c98b9/content/posts/cve-2026-50651.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2026-50651.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/844aa1c07ff44ac335acd204e892575064d9be94/cve/CVE-2026-50651.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0362.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0361","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0361.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50648","title":"微软 .NET XML 加密拒绝服务漏洞","description":".NET Framework 中的 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml 命名空间下的 XML 加密实现（EncryptedXml）存在资源未受限制分配漏洞（CWE-770）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向使用受影响版本 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml NuGet 包的 .NET 应用发送特制的加密 XML 数据，触发无限制的资源消耗，导致目标服务拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 .NET 8.0（8.0.0 至 8.0.28）、.NET 9.0（9.0.0 至 9.0.17）以及 .NET 10.0（10.0.0 至 10.0.9）的所有平台和架构，攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限或用户交互即可完成利用，主要危害为系统不可用。Microsoft 已发布安全更新修复该漏洞，受影响版本的用户应将 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml 包升级至对应已修复版本（.NET 8.0.29、.NET 9.0.18 或 .NET 10.0.10）并重新编译部署应用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50648","GHSA-23rf-6693-g89p"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T20:17:37Z","updated":"2026-07-22T21:17:41Z","remediation":"立即将 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml 包升级到补丁版本：将 .NET 8.0 升级到 8.0.29、.NET 9.0 升级到 9.0.18、.NET 10.0 升级到 10.0.10。使用 NuGet 命令行执行 `dotnet add package System.Security.Cryptography.Xml --version 8.0.29`、`dotnet add package System.Security.Cryptography.Xml --version 9.0.18`、`dotnet add package System.Security.Cryptography.Xml --version 10.0.10` 进行升级，或通过 Visual Studio 的 NuGet 包管理器进行升级，然后重新编译部署应用以彻底修复这一拒绝服务漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-50648","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/8284a6b46d384416350a482bbbfb023f0fdf4177/release-notes/10.0/cve.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50648.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-50648.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-50648","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/5e42b0394af9ea9a92d3a9525f7e445dad9e5f7c/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-50648.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/nuget/System.Security.Cryptography.Xml/CVE-2026-50648.yml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-50648.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/e4d54534d9963512bc05d4e90b2e3212401aa945/cve/CVE-2026-50648.html","https://github.com/dotnet/docs/blob/b2bd326ace411a28756f9f2e93e21ff289840a56/docs/framework/release-notes/2026/07-14-july-cumulative-update.md","https://github.com/AzureAD/microsoft-identity-web/blob/dba8a0c46bb1153dc2b782c6484d92d5beb56bc5/Directory.Build.props"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0361.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0356","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0356.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50528","title":"微软 .NET TLS/SSL 安全特性绕过漏洞","description":"这是一个针对微软 .NET 的安全功能绕过漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 TLS/SSL 网络数据包，利用 .NET 中 System.Net.Security 组件实现的授权检查缺陷绕过安全验证。当处理安全的网络通信时，攻击者能滥用未授权的权限访问 .NET 应用，这是由于安全流处理的认证逻辑存在缺陷。漏洞影响范围广泛，任何部署受影响版本 .NET 8、.NET 9 或 .NET 10 的应用程序都可能受到威胁，包括所有平台和架构。该漏洞属于高危级别，CVSS 评分为 8.2，通过网络远程攻击即可触发，攻击者无需身份验证即可发起攻击。该漏洞在 .NET 的安全通信协议上发现，通过 HTTPS 建立的网络连接中尤其容易受到攻击，攻击者能伪造合法的安全会话并绕过访问控制。该漏洞导致 .NET 安全机制失效，可能引发未经授权的数据访问或系统控制风险，已在 .NET 的安全补丁版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50528","GHSA-qvw7-jm5c-6hqw"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T20:17:37Z","updated":"2026-07-22T21:17:41Z","remediation":"立即升级 .NET 运行时：.NET 8.0 升级至 8.0.29 或更高版本，.NET 9.0 升级至 9.0.18 或更高版本，.NET 10.0 升级至 10.0.10 或更高版本。通过运行 `dotnet --info` 确认当前版本，通过 Visual Studio Installer 或下载 .NET SDK 进行升级。引用 Microsoft.NetCore.App.Runtime.* NuGet 包的项目需更新包引用至对应修复版本。自包含部署应用需重新编译并重新部署。升级后必须重启所有 .NET 应用使补丁生效。暂无有效临时缓解措施，必须升级运行时修复此 TLS/SSL 授权绕过漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-50528","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/8284a6b46d384416350a482bbbfb023f0fdf4177/release-notes/10.0/cve.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50528.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-50528.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-50528","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50528.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/88faa9369b8bcb4bdc7ab12bd672bb5c791c1c4b/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-50528.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/nuget/Microsoft.NETCore.App.Runtime.win-x86/CVE-2026-50528.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/76fdd7fe4cd9d55f9aa8c105cb90aa42e34c98b9/content/posts/cve-2026-50528.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2026-50528.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/634d12df2886254577e2fb10cf0313d024ae3a2f/cve/CVE-2026-50528.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0356.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0355","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0355.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50526","title":"Microsoft .NET SDK 容器镜像构建过程本地资源注入篡改漏洞","description":".NET SDK (Microsoft.NET.Build.Containers) 容器镜像构建过程中存在不当链接解析漏洞 (CWE-59)，本地低权限攻击者可通过链接跟随方式注入恶意资源，导致同一台机器上其他用户构建的容器镜像被篡改。影响 .NET 8.0.0-8.0.28、.NET 9.0.0-9.0.17、.NET 10.0.0-10.0.9 版本，CVSS 7.0 高危，影响机密性、完整性、可用性均为高。攻击需本地低权限访问且攻击复杂度高，无需用户交互。Microsoft 已发布修复版本 (.NET 8.0.29/9.0.18/10.0.10)，建议升级 SDK 并重新编译部署自包含应用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50526","GHSA-55jh-fwmh-39m4"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T20:17:37Z","updated":"2026-07-22T21:17:40Z","remediation":"立即更新到修正版本：对于.NET 8用户请升级至8.0.29及以上版本；对于.NET 9用户请升级至9.0.18及以上版本；对于.NET 10用户请升级至10.0.10及以上版本。更新完成后重启应用程序生效。对于自包含应用程序，请重新编译并部署更新后的版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-50526","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/8284a6b46d384416350a482bbbfb023f0fdf4177/release-notes/10.0/cve.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50526.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_3_CVE-2026-50526.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-50526","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50526.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/88faa9369b8bcb4bdc7ab12bd672bb5c791c1c4b/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-50526.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2026-50526.md","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/03c8f76a32366704fc95021efe40830fb6fc3193/community/dotnet9-runtime/APKBUILD","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-55jh-fwmh-39m4/GHSA-55jh-fwmh-39m4.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-50526.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0355.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0354","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0354.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50525","title":"Microsoft .NET XML加密拒绝服务漏洞","description":".NET XML 加密实现 (System.Security.Cryptography.Xml 中的 EncryptedXml) 存在资源分配无限制漏洞 (CWE-770)。攻击者可构造恶意加密 XML 数据，触发不受控的资源消耗，导致拒绝服务。影响 .NET 8.0.0-8.0.28、.NET 9.0.0-9.0.17、.NET 10.0.0-10.0.9 版本中使用 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml 包的应用，CVSS 7.5 (HIGH)，网络远程利用、低攻击复杂度、无需权限和用户交互。攻击者仅需发送精心构造的加密 XML 数据即可触发资源耗尽导致服务拒绝。微软已在 .NET 8.0.29、.NET 9.0.18、.NET 10.0.10 中修复，开发者需升级 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml NuGet 包至修复版本并重新编译部署应用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50525","GHSA-8q5v-6pqq-x66h"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T20:17:37Z","updated":"2026-07-22T21:17:40Z","remediation":"立即通过 NuGet 更新 System.Security.Cryptography.Xml 包：.NET 8.0 升级到 8.0.29，.NET 9.0 升级到 9.0.18，.NET 10.0 升级到 10.0.10。使用 Visual Studio NuGet 包管理器、Package Manager Console 执行 `Update-Package -Id System.Security.Cryptography.Xml` 或 .NET CLI 执行 `dotnet add package System.Security.Cryptography.Xml` 更新后重新编译部署应用。建议同步更新 .NET Runtime/SDK 到对应版本（8.0.29/9.0.18/10.0.10）以获得完整防护。若暂时无法升级，可在网络层限制非受信 XML 输入作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-50525","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/8284a6b46d38